[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:Tickets, Please.]
[00:01.12]Lesson 95 | 第95课
[00:03.05]Tickets, please. | 请出示车票。
[00:05.78]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音，然后回答问题。
[00:11.70]Why did George and Ken miss the train? | 乔治和肯为什么误了火车？
[00:17.91]Two return tickets to London, please. | 请给我两张到伦敦的往返票。
[00:22.88]What time will the next train leave? | 下一班火车什么时候开？
[00:26.68]At nineteen minutes past eight. | 八点十九分。
[00:30.87]Which platform? | 哪个站台？
[00:33.12]Platform Two. | 二号站台。
[00:34.93]Over the bridge. | 从天桥过去。
[00:37.41]What time will the next train leave? | 下一班火车什么时候开？
[00:41.76]At eight nineteen. | 八点十九分。
[00:44.50]We've got plenty of time. | 我们时间很充裕。
[00:47.96]It's only three minutes to eight. | 现在才差三分钟八点。
[00:52.14]Let's go and have a drink. | 我们去喝一杯吧。
[00:55.25]There's a bar next door to the station. | 车站旁边有个酒吧。
[01:00.22]We had better go back to the station now, Ken. | 肯，我们现在最好回车站了。
[01:05.17]Tickets, please. | 请出示车票。
[01:07.59]We want to catch the eight nineteen to London. | 我们想乘八点十九分去伦敦的火车。
[01:12.68]You've just missed it! | 你们刚错过了！
[01:15.16]What! | 什么！
[01:16.75]It's only eight fifteen. | 现在才八点十五分。
[01:19.72]I'm sorry, sir. | 对不起，先生。
[01:22.12]That clock's ten minutes slow. | 那个钟慢了十分钟。
[01:25.43]When's the next train? | 下一班火车什么时候开？
[01:28.55]In five hours' time! | 五个小时以后！